## 1. DESIGN SYSTEM: MINIMALIST DARK NEO-BRUTALISM

Refactor `static/css/custom.css` and all templates in `templates/` (`base.html`, `login.html`, `dashboard.html`, `single_upload.html`, `batch_upload.html`, `batch_detail.html`, `inspection_detail.html`, `supervisor_queue.html`, `metrics_dashboard.html`, `products.html`) to strictly follow a **Minimalist Dark Neo-Brutalist** aesthetic:

### 1.1 Color Palette (CSS Variables in `:root`)
- **Canvas Background (`--bg-main`):** `#0A0B0E` (Deep Obsidian)
- **Surface / Card Background (`--bg-panel`):** `#12141A` (Matte Charcoal)
- **Elevated / Input Background (`--bg-elevated`):** `#181B24`
- **Structural Border (`--border-strong`):** `#2E3440` (Default `2px solid`) and `#E2E8F0` (Active/High-contrast `2px solid`)
- **Hard Brutalist Shadow (`--shadow-brutal`):** `4px 4px 0px #000000` (Strictly `0px` blur everywhere)
- **Accent Shadow (`--shadow-accent`):** `4px 4px 0px #00E5FF`
- **Primary Text (`--text-primary`):** `#F1F5F9`
- **Muted / Telemetry Label Text (`--text-muted`):** `#8A94A6`
- **Primary Industrial Accent (`--accent-cyan`):** `#00E5FF`
- **Semantic Status Colors:**
  - **NORMAL / PASS (`--status-normal`):** `#00FF66` (Signal Emerald border & text on `#052E16` background)
  - **DEFECTIVE / FAIL (`--status-defect`):** `#FF2A55` (High-Voltage Crimson border & text on `#3B0712` background)
  - **VALIDATION FAILED / WARNING (`--status-warn`):** `#FFB800` (Hazard Amber border & text on `#332100` background)
  - **QUEUED / PROCESSING (`--status-queue`):** `#00E5FF` (Cyber Cyan border & text on `#042630` background)

### 1.2 Typography & Brutalist Geometry
- Load Google Fonts in `base.html`: `'Space Grotesk'` (weights 500, 700) for headings/UI and `'JetBrains Mono'` (weights 400, 600, 700) for all IDs (`P-PLATE01`), filenames, confidence percentages, defect probabilities, timestamps, confusion matrix cells, and status badges.
- **Zero Rounded Corners:** Enforce `border-radius: 0px !important;` across all cards, buttons, inputs, selects, alerts, badges, modals, progress bars, and tables.
- **No Gradients or Soft Shadows:** Remove all soft drop-shadows and gradients. Every card/panel must have `border: 2px solid var(--border-strong); background: var(--bg-panel); box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px #000000;`.
- **Mechanical Button Physics:**
  - Buttons must use uppercase `JetBrains Mono` or `Space Grotesk`, `font-weight: 700`, `letter-spacing: 0.05em`, `border: 2px solid #F1F5F9`, and `box-shadow: 3px 3px 0px #000000`.
  - On `:hover`: `transform: translate(-1px, -1px); box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px var(--accent-cyan);`
  - On `:active`: `transform: translate(2px, 2px); box-shadow: 1px 1px 0px #000000;`
- **Minimalist Layout Discipline:**
  - Eliminate decorative fluff, marketing text, or bloated hero banners.
  - Use clean exposed grid borders, compact uppercase section headers (`01 // TELEMETRY`, `02 // UPLOAD GATE`, `03 // CONFUSION MATRIX`), and high-density tabular data with `font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums`.

